Source landscape: The documentary universe is broad and permits triangulation across Vietnamese government/statistical records, UN agencies, World Bank, WHO, UNICEF, UNDP, ILO, OECD, legal repositories, household surveys, health-system studies, and critical reporting. The strongest discovery clusters concern poverty and inequality, social protection, health insurance and primary care, education, WASH, ethnic-minority and vulnerable-group outcomes, crisis response, administrative capacity, and measurement quality. Search results also surfaced older baseline documents and later retrospective sources useful for interpreting 2023; these remain candidates rather than evidence claims. All URLs below are search-discovered and therefore marked `unopened`.

